# Module folders

Each domain package (`identity/`, `profiles/`, later matching, chat, …) uses folders, not one `schemas.py`.

```text
src/<module>/
  router.py
  schemas/       # one file per request or response model
  models/        # Beanie documents
  services/      # business logic
  middleware/    # module-specific FastAPI dependencies
```

- Do not add a global `dto/`, `controllers/`, or `schemas/` at `src/` root.
- `core/` stays shared infra (`config.py`, `database.py`) — not a feature module.
- New product areas get a new package with this same layout.
- Split a schema file only inside that module’s `schemas/` folder.
